### 錯誤處理

```typescript
// PASS: 良好：完整的錯誤處理
async function fetchData(url: string) {
  try {
    const response = await fetch(url)

    if (!response.ok) {
      throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}: ${response.statusText}`)
